#25003
Mouth of the Uller River~
   The banks lie far apart here, where the Uller River spills its waters
into the Widmans.  Far off in the darkness of the trees you feel the
Forestkeeper watching as you move through his domain.  With some effort
you can row upstream on the Uller to the north, and the Widmans lies to
the south.
