#25010
At the Bank of the Uller River~
   The Uller River crashes down from a huge waterfall to the north,
filling the air with spray and thunder.  Named for a great warrior of
days long past, the river moves much as he did: swiftly and without
remorse.  This little eddy is the only place in sight where you can get
on or off the river.  A trail for the less timid leads east.
~
